  "question": "求 $\\lim_{n\\to \\infty}\\sin \\frac{\\pi}{n}\\sum_{k = 1}^{n}\\frac{1}{2 + \\cos\\frac{k\\pi}{n}}.$",
  "answer": "$\\sin \\frac{\\pi}{n} \\sim \\frac{\\pi}{n}$",
  "ref_source": "textbook:puheping_math_contest_v2",
